OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA mostly bright start with
OL,6,Fcloud bubbling up, leaving a mixture
OL,7,Fof sunny spells scattered showers.
OL,8,FThese turning heavy at times with the
OL,9,Frisk of thunder and hail. Feeling
OL,10,Ffresher.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FStayed mixed during Thursday and
OL,14,FFriday with slow-moving heavy
OL,15,Fdownpours with the chance of thunder.
OL,16,FMore settled through Saturday with
OL,17,Fsunny spells and the odd shower.
OL,18,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
